      "writtenOn": "2016-06-23T17:46:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "might be a bit confusing:\nusbpdmuxinfo is working only on systems with virtual mux,,\nto get the mux info on other systems one would need to call \u0027usbpd\u0027 command ?\nWe probably need to put a slightly more precise description\n(or put muxinfo host command on all type-C platform at the expense of size ?)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 220,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 227,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "f53c2dafe707201f688bb72997691b37421e0b82",
