        "id": 1001696
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-06-23T18:16:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I agree it is slightly confusing to have two sub-commands. I was thinking that EC_CMD_USB_PD_MUX_INFO could be added later to non-virtual mux platforms, if desired (but left it out for RAM / flash savings).\n\nI will modify the usbpdmuxinfo sub-command to use the other host command (which can\u0027t get inverted state, but that\u0027s mostly fine) in the case that EC_CMD_USB_PD_MUX_INFO fails. So, users of ectool can just use usbpdmuxinfo in all cases.",
      "parentUuid": "230bc962_0f61a51c",
